OL,3,GNEWSAOxford extends world-topping
OL,4,Astreak for 11th year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe University of Oxford has been named
OL,7,Fthe top university in the world for an
OL,8,F11th straight year.
OL,10,FIt continues its record-breaking streak
OL,11,Fat the top of the Times Higher
OL,12,FEducation's (THE) World University
OL,13,FRankings 2027, which considered 2,297
OL,14,Funiversities from 118 countries.
OL,16,FThe University of Cambridge and
OL,17,FImperial College London also claim
OL,18,Fspots in the top 10 positions.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
